OL,3,GNEWSASupermarket and GP clinic a step
OL,4,Acloser in new town
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new town's first supermarket has been
OL,7,Fgranted planning permission, despite
OL,8,Fobjections from a water company.
OL,10,FLidl plans to open the store on Station
OL,11,FRoad in Northstowe, Cambridgeshire,
OL,12,Fhowever Anglian Water said a nearby
OL,13,FWater Recycling Centre (WRC) 'lacks the
OL,14,Fcapacity' to accommodate more useage.
OL,16,FPlanning documents show only two
OL,17,Fresidents objected to the plans, with
OL,18,F37 supporting it.
