OL,3,GNEWSASupermarket and GP clinic a step
OL,4,Acloser in new town
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision comes at the same time
OL,7,FSouth Cambridgeshire District Council
OL,8,Fsubmitted a planning application for a
OL,9,Fnew town hub, which will include a GP
OL,10,Fsurgery, library and cafe.
